# Accepted risks. Each entry needs a reason; review them in docs/SECURITY.md when the context changes.

# Public ALB: this is the product's public entry point (ingestion API + dashboard).
AVD-AWS-0053

# HTTP listener: redirects to HTTPS whenever certificate_arn is set (production.tfvars). It only
# forwards plain HTTP in demo environments without a certificate.
AVD-AWS-0054

# Unrestricted egress on app tasks: delivering webhooks means calling arbitrary customer URLs.
# Mitigated in the application by the connect-time SSRF guard (private/link-local/metadata ranges
# blocked after DNS resolution, redirects not followed). See docs/SECURITY.md#ssrf.
AVD-AWS-0104
